<title>USA: Oryx sees 1997 net income in $150 mln range.</title>
<headline>Oryx sees 1997 net income in $150 mln range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oryx Energy Co said Tuesday that the company is comfortable with consensus estimates for 1997 operating net income in the $150 million range and discretionary cash flow of about $575 million.</p>
<p>The company issued a news release saying that as a result of good Gulf of Mexico volumes, the company expects seven to eight percent annual production increases in both 1997 and 1998.</p>
<p>The company said it expects an increase in volumes to about 80 million equivalent barrels in 1998.</p>
<p>Oryx is an independent oil and gas company.</p>
</text>
